    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setup Post\n1. Create HTTP request node\n2. Select method to be POST\n3. Select the URL base on the \n- [Doc](https://developers.line.biz/en/reference/messaging-api/#send-reply-message)\n- Method send reply message \n4. Set authentication to be **Generic Credential Type**\n5. Select Generaic Auth to be **Header Auth Account**\n- Name = Authorization\n- Value = Bearer {Token}\n\n** Token **\nFind by \n- Go to [Line Console] \n- Choose channel\n- Go to buttom of the page an issue the token",
        "height": 384,
